I zoomed on the two double doors near the top of the drawing: the "FM 丙0518/丙1518" pair and the double door at about (470–560, 355–395). Both have two arcs of similar size, so they don't match. The "M1121" doors in the top-right are single doors. I did not zoom on the two lower tiles. From the overview, they show no door arcs of this kind.

