I found three instances. All three are FM 乙1221 doors: a large quarter-circle leaf with a small leaf beside it. They are at about (275, 415), (1335, 75) and (800, 1545). The one at (800, 1545) is a mirror image of the reference.

The other doors I zoomed in on did not match: FM 丙1518, FM 丙0518, the blue pair near (1400, 270) and the FM 甲152 door. The FM 丙1818 door near (410, 1190) I judged from the overview only, not zoomed, and it looked like an equal pair. I did not zoom into every door on the sheet, so I may have missed some.

